                                                "sense_id": "823fcf7e-798e-382d-8ef5-426f5482396e",
                                                "text": "Frequent conflicts over water have occurred historically in this Middle Eastern region because of its natural water scarcity, the introduction of irrigated agriculture, and the tensions of religious and ethnic diversity."
